    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG Terenure are delighted to present 27A Greenmount Lawn to the market, a superb two-bedroom own-door apartment presented in true turn-key condition and boasting one of its most outstanding features a private south-facing rear garden. Offering bright, stylish accommodation together with exceptional outdoor space, this impressive home is sure to appeal to first-time buyers, downsizers and investors alike.\n\nBeautifully maintained and tastefully upgraded, No. 27A is ready for immediate occupation, allowing the successful purchaser to simply unpack and enjoy. The well-designed accommodation is flooded with natural light and offers a perfect balance of comfort and practicality for modern living.\n\nThe accommodation briefly comprises a welcoming entrance hallway, a spacious open-plan living and dining and kitchen, two bedrooms and a contemporary family bathroom. Finished to an excellent standard throughout, the property is presented in immaculate decorative order, making it an ideal choice for those seeking a home with nothing further to do.\n\nA truly standout feature of this exceptional property is the private south-facing rear garden. Rarely found with apartment living, this sun-drenched outdoor space provides the perfect setting for al fresco dining, entertaining family and friends, gardening enthusiasts or simply relaxing in complete privacy. Beautifully maintained and offering excellent privacy, the garden creates a seamless extension of the internal living accommodation and sets this home apart from comparable properties on the market.\n\nThe location is simply unrivalled. Greenmount Lawn is a mature and highly regarded residential development nestled between Terenure, Harold's Cross and Kimmage, placing a superb selection of cafés, restaurants, shops, parks and leisure facilities all within easy walking distance. Bushy Park, Sundrive Park and Harold's Cross Park are all close by, while the area is renowned for its excellent transport links, providing swift and convenient access to Dublin City Centre and beyond.\n\nCombining immaculate turn-key presentation, bright accommodation, a superb private south-facing garden and an enviable Dublin 6W address, 27A Greenmount Lawn represents a rare opportunity to acquire a home of genuine quality in one of South Dublin's most sought-after locations.\n\nEarly viewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nLiving Room - 2.57m × 3.96m\n\n\nBreakfast Kitchen - 2.85m × 3.26m\n\n\nBedroom 1 (top left) - 3.83m × 1.93m\n\n\nBedroom 2 (top right) - 2.39m × 3.58m\n\n\nBathroom - 1.85m × 2.84m\n\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
