        "Content": "<ul><li> Superb two-bedroom own-door apartment</li><li> Presented in immaculate turn-key condition</li><li> Private south-facing rear garden</li><li> Bright and spacious accommodation</li><li> Spacious open-plan living and dining area</li><li> Modern fitted kitchen</li><li> Two bedrooms</li><li> Contemporary family bathroom</li><li> Excellent storage throughout</li><li> Double-glazed windows</li><li> Gas-fired central heating</li><li> Quiet and mature residential development</li><li> Prime Dublin 6W location</li><li> Walking distance to Terenure, Harold's Cross and Kimmage villages</li><li> Close to Bushy Park, Sundrive Park and a host of local amenities</li><li> Excellent public transport links to Dublin City Centre</li><li> Ideal for first-time buyers, downsizers and investors</li><li> Early viewing highly recommended</ul>"
